          <li>L<sub>1</sub>(2.5) = (2.5 - 0)(2.5 - 2)(2.5 - 4) / [(1 - 0)(1 - 2)(1 - 4)] = (2.5)(0.5)(-1.5) / [(1)(-1)(-3)] = -1.875 / 3 = -0.625</li>
          <li>L<sub>2</sub>(2.5) = (2.5 - 0)(2.5 - 1)(2.5 - 4) / [(2 - 0)(2 - 1)(2 - 4)] = (2.5)(1.5)(-1.5) / [(2)(1)(-2)] = -5.625 / -4 = 1.40625</li>
