            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p><strong>Solución:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>L<sub>0</sub>(x) = (x - 1)(x - 3) / [(0 - 1)(0 - 3)] = (x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 3) / 3</li>
          <li>L<sub>1</sub>(x) = (x - 0)(x - 3) / [(1 - 0)(1 - 3)] = (x<sup>2</sup> - 3x) / -2</li>
          <li>L<sub>2</sub>(x) = (x - 0)(x - 1) / [(3 - 0)(3 - 1)] = (x<sup>2</sup> - x) / 6</li>
          <li>P<sub>2</sub>(x) = 1[(x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 3)/3] + 3[(x<sup>2</sup> - 3x)/-2] + 13[(x<sup>2</sup> - x)/6] = (6x<sup>2</sup> + 6x + 6) / 6 = x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1</li>
          <li>f(2) ≈ P<sub>2</sub>(2) = (2)<sup>2</sup> + 2 + 1 = 7</li>
