        <p>Construye un polinomio de tercer grado para aproximar f(1.5).</p>
        <p><strong>Solución:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>L<sub>0</sub>(1.5) = (1.5 - 1)(1.5 - 2)(1.5 - 3) / [(0 - 1)(0 - 2)(0 - 3)] = (0.5)(-0.5)(-1.5) / [(-1)(-2)(-3)] = 0.375 / -6 = -0.0625</li>
          <li>L<sub>1</sub>(1.5) = (1.5 - 0)(1.5 - 2)(1.5 - 3) / [(1 - 0)(1 - 2)(1 - 3)] = (1.5)(-0.5)(-1.5) / [(1)(-1)(-2)] = 1.125 / 2 = 0.5625</li>
          <li>L<sub>2</sub>(1.5) = (1.5 - 0)(1.5 - 1)(1.5 - 3) / [(2 - 0)(2 - 1)(2 - 3)] = (1.5)(0.5)(-1.5) / [(2)(1)(-1)] = -1.125 / -2 = 0.5625</li>
          <li>L<sub>3</sub>(1.5) = (1.5 - 0)(1.5 - 1)(1.5 - 2) / [(3 - 0)(3 - 1)(3 - 2)] = (1.5)(0.5)(-0.5) / [(3)(2)(1)] = -0.375 / 6 = -0.0625</li>
          <li>P<sub>3</sub>(x) = x<sup>3</sup> + x + 1</li>
          <li>P<sub>3</sub>(1.5) = 1(-0.0625) + 2(0.5625) + 11(0.5625) + 34(-0.0625) = -0.0625 + 1.125 + 6.1875 - 2.125 = 5.125</li>
