        <p><strong>Solución:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>L<sub>0</sub>(3) = (3 - 2)(3 - 4)(3 - 5) / [(1 - 2)(1 - 4)(1 - 5)] = (1)(-1)(-2) / [(-1)(-3)(-4)] = 2 / -12 = -1/6</li>
          <li>L<sub>1</sub>(3) = (3 - 1)(3 - 4)(3 - 5) / [(2 - 1)(2 - 4)(2 - 5)] = (2)(-1)(-2) / [(1)(-2)(-3)] = 4 / 6 = 2/3</li>
          <li>L<sub>2</sub>(3) = (3 - 1)(3 - 2)(3 - 5) / [(4 - 1)(4 - 2)(4 - 5)] = (2)(1)(-2) / [(3)(2)(-1)] = -4 / -6 = 2/3</li>
          <li>L<sub>3</sub>(3) = (3 - 1)(3 - 2)(3 - 4) / [(5 - 1)(5 - 2)(5 - 4)] = (2)(1)(-1) / [(4)(3)(1)] = -2 / 12 = -1/6</li>
          <li>F<sub>3</sub>(x) = x<sup>2</sup> - x + 2</li>
          <li>F<sub>3</sub>(3) = 2(-1/6) + 4(2/3) + 14(2/3) + 22(-1/6) = -2/6 + 8/3 + 28/3 - 22/6 = -4 + 12 = 8</li>
