        <p>Construir el polinomio de tercer grado y aproximar f(2.5).</p>
        <p><strong>Solución:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>L<sub>0</sub>(x) = (x - 1)(x - 2)(x - 4) / [(0 - 1)(0 - 2)(0 - 4)] = -(x<sup>3</sup> - 7x<sup>2</sup> + 14x - 8) / 8</li>
          <li>L<sub>1</sub>(x) = (x - 0)(x - 2)(x - 4) / [(1 - 0)(1 - 2)(1 - 4)] = (x<sup>3</sup> - 6x<sup>2</sup> + 8x) / 3</li>
          <li>L<sub>2</sub>(x) = (x - 0)(x - 1)(x - 4) / [(2 - 0)(2 - 1)(2 - 4)] = -(x<sup>3</sup> - 5x<sup>2</sup> + 4x) / 4</li>
          <li>L<sub>3</sub>(x) = (x - 0)(x - 1)(x - 2) / [(4 - 0)(4 - 1)(4 - 2)] = (x<sup>3</sup> - 3x<sup>2</sup> + 2x) / 24</li>
          <li><strong>Polinomio simplificado:</strong> P<sub>3</sub>(x) = 2L<sub>0</sub>(x) + 5L<sub>1</sub>(x) + 16L<sub>2</sub>(x) + 86L<sub>3</sub>(x) = x<sup>3</sup> + 2x + 2</li>
          <li><strong>Evaluación en x = 2.5:</strong> P<sub>3</sub>(2.5) = (2.5)<sup>3</sup> + 2(2.5) + 2 = 15.625 + 5 + 2 = 22.625</li>
